  "title": "VALHI REPORTS SECOND QUARTER 2026 RESULTS",
  "summary": "Dallas, Texas, Aug. 06, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Valhi, Inc. (NYSE: VHI) reported net income attributable to Valhi stockholders of $22.3 million, or $.78 per share, in the second quarter of 2026 compared to net income of $.9 million, or $.03 per share, in the second quarter of 2025.",
